[I] A minimal hash C library - utility application

[T] CMPH (C Minimal Perfect Hashing Library) encapsulates efficient
[T] algorithms for constructing minimal perfect hash functions in an
[T] easy-to-use, fast API. It is designed to work with very large key sets
[T] that cannot fit in main memory, and includes the cmph command-line
[T] utility.

[U] https://cmph.sourceforge.net/

[A] Cmph Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

